msgid ""
"You need mahjong sticks to play mahjong. How much you lookin' to buy? It's 1"
" yen a stick."
msgstr ""
"Ti servono i bastoncini per giocare a mahjong. Quanti ne vuoi comprare? "
"Costano 1 yen l'uno."

